      "y": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Sandbox vs production — what changes",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:41:46.980Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:41:46.980Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "env-t-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 76,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Same Terraform, two profiles: envs/sandbox.env and envs/production.env, each overlaid on .env.template   ·   STACK_ENV prefixes the Terraform state keys   ·   dashed = optional",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:41:46.980Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:41:46.980Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
