    {
      "id": "env-t-114",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1032,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Values from envs/sandbox.env and envs/production.env on sandbox-deploy; the production profile leaves the domain values blank to fill in. Build .env with: cat .env.template envs/<env>.env > .env, then run deploy.sh.\nBoth profiles also get the Bedrock budget and token alarm (ALARM_EMAIL). Drawn 2026-10-22, updated for the domain, edge WAF, per-AZ NAT and CPU-only scaling.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:41:46.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:41:46.985Z",
      "version": 1,
      "originalText": "Values from envs/sandbox.env and envs/production.env on sandbox-deploy; the production profile leaves the domain values blank to fill in. Build .env with: cat .env.template envs/<env>.env > .env, then run deploy.sh.\nBoth profiles also get the Bedrock budget and token alarm (ALARM_EMAIL). Drawn 2026-10-22, updated for the domain, edge WAF, per-AZ NAT and CPU-only scaling."
    }
